 # Changelog
 
+## S306p THE LANDING TOOL: THE SINGLE WRITER OF A BANKED CARD'S ARC (the framework's thin path, T11; P-885) (2026-11-27)
+
+- **`scripts/queue/land.py`:** a card the queue holds VERIFIED, by the runner's move on two ACCEPTs, is landed by this
+  tool alone. It holds a lock (one landing at a time) and works on a fresh clone of main. It takes the arc's number and the
+  harvest row's at landing, one more than the highest on the clone. It writes the arc's folder (FINDINGS.md and
